{"title": "Rage Becomes Frenzy", "pageid": 23220, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rage_Becomes_Frenzy", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Frenzy.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Frenzy.webp/300px-Frenzy.webp, /w/images/c/ce/Frenzy.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Frenzy.webp/300px-Frenzy.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Frenzy.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Rage Becomes Frenzy</b> is a passive feature that changes <a href=\"/wiki/Rage\" title=\"Rage\">Rage</a> into <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\">Frenzy</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your bloodthirst transforms your rage, making it stronger. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/40px-Frenzy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/60px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/80px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/40px-Frenzy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\">Frenzy</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Berserker\" title=\"Berserker\">Berserker</a></li></ul>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abby\" title=\"Abby\">Abby</a></li></ul>\n</div>        \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195652\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 699/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3885/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 905/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 758767/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.163      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.163      1 -total\n 18.73%    5.837      1 Template:PageSeo\n 17.38%    5.417      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.21%    3.805      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 12.16%    3.791      1 Template:SAI\n 10.33%    3.220      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.94%    3.098      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.31%    2.900      1 Template:Icon_text\n  6.08%    1.895      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23220-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195652 and revision id 289658. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}